  "notes": "USAGE:\nAn ichidan verb often used in the te-form {秀|ひい}でて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (excels, is outstanding) or as the prenominal modifier {秀|ひい}でた (outstanding, excellent). Takes the particle ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ to indicate the field of excellence.\n\nMore literary than ⟦{優|すぐ}れる→優れる：02119_sugureru⟧ (to be superior), which is the more common everyday equivalent.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ～⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{秀|ひい}でる: to excel in...\n- {秀|ひい}でた⟦{才能|さいのう}→才能：02772_sainou⟧: outstanding talent\n- {秀|ひい}でた⟦{能力|のうりょく}→能力：03541_nouryoku⟧: exceptional ability\n- ひときわ{秀|ひい}でる: to stand out remarkably",
